Personally, I would instead try to acquire the jumping spell, and keep
the jumping boots.  You can jump as far, if not farther with the
jumping spell (if the escape skill is leveled up).  Plus, you will
still retain very fast speed.  It allows you to keep your speed
boots.  You can take a turn, then jump, then take a turn then jump...
The only problem is that this strategy will use up a lot more mana,
but it will recover quickly with the eye.





